# Agent conventions (main-web)

At the start of substantial tasks in this repo, **read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) with the Read tool** (not the shell). Keep that file as the source of truth; update it when team conventions change.

## Read files with IDE tools

- Use **Read**, **Grep**, and **Glob** for source and config.
- Do **not** dump file contents via terminal (`cat`, `type`, `Get-Content`, `head`, `tail`, etc.) or scripts (`python -c`, `node -e`, etc.).

## PowerShell — no `&&`

Windows PowerShell 5.x rejects `&&`. In **agent terminal commands**, do not chain with `&&`.

- Prefer **one command per shell invocation**, or `;`, or `if ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) { ... }`.
- Existing `package.json` scripts using `&&` under `yarn`/`npm run` are unchanged unless you are fixing Windows compatibility.

